  "name": "tier-ladder-v1",
  "description": "18/09/2026, Dean's full cost ladder: a Tier N building costs N cards of its own crop. Tier 1 -> 1 own, Tier 2 -> 2 own, Tier 3 -> 3 own, every wild requirement deleted. The cleanest teach in the design ('it costs what tier it is') and the biggest single change to the economy in this pass: it cheapens EVERY tier by about one card and removes every any-crop slot, so it is a monoculture pull as well as a discount. Read game length and crop win rates before anything else; a much shorter game is the expected failure. NOTE the collision it creates: Tier 2 and the Power and Endgame cards would both cost 2 cards of own crop.",
